{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Count</b> — Count this iniquity, that they be reckoned and boast along with their iniquity." "<b>And let them not enter</b> — Rabbi Moses said: its sense is by way of the charity that should be done with them. In my opinion: Scripture explained what follows it, 'and among the righteous let them not be written.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 69, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:33:46.923962437Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}